-- Crafting rework C2: Herbalism (182), Mining (186) and Skinning (393) leave the primary profession category
-- (11) for the secondary one (9), so they no longer count against MaxPrimaryTradeSkill. Every character can learn
-- all three plus two crafting professions. Full stock SkillLine.dbc rows; only CategoryID changes.
DELETE FROM `skillline_dbc` WHERE `ID` IN (182, 186, 393);
